sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Staff as Cashier / Manager
    participant UI as POS Client / Web
    participant AuthEP as POST /auth/login
    participant LoginSvc as LoginService
    participant Hasher as BCryptPinHasher
    participant DB as PurchDbContext
    participant JWT as JwtTokenService

    Note over Staff,DB: 1. Counter Staff Login (Device Code + PIN)
    Staff->>UI: Enter Pairing Code & 4-6 digit numeric PIN
    UI->>AuthEP: POST /auth/login { devicePairingCode, pin }
    AuthEP->>LoginSvc: LoginAsync(request)
    LoginSvc->>DB: Query Device by PairingCode
    alt Device Not Found / Inactive
        LoginSvc-->>AuthEP: LoginResult.InvalidDevice
        AuthEP-->>UI: 401 Unauthorized (Generic Credential Error)
    else Device Found
        LoginSvc->>DB: Query Users where TenantId == Device.TenantId and IsActive
        LoginSvc->>Hasher: Verify(pin, user.PinHash)
        alt Pin Mismatch
            LoginSvc-->>AuthEP: LoginResult.InvalidPin
            AuthEP-->>UI: 401 Unauthorized (Generic Credential Error)
        else Pin Matches
            LoginSvc->>JWT: GenerateAccessToken(user, device)
            LoginSvc->>JWT: GenerateRefreshToken(user, device)
            LoginSvc->>DB: Insert RefreshToken entity (SHA-256 hash)
            LoginSvc-->>AuthEP: LoginResult.Success(AccessToken, RefreshToken)
            AuthEP-->>UI: 200 OK { accessToken, refreshToken }
            UI->>UI: Store AccessToken in Memory & RefreshToken in SecureStorage
        end
    end

    Note over Staff,DB: 2. Web Admin Login (Email + Password)
    actor Admin as Business Admin
    Admin->>UI: Enter Email & Password
    UI->>AuthEP: POST /auth/admin-login { email, password }
    AuthEP->>LoginSvc: AdminLoginAsync(request)
    LoginSvc->>DB: Query User by Email where Role == Admin and IsActive
    alt Admin Not Found or Invalid Password
        LoginSvc-->>AuthEP: LoginResult.InvalidAdminCredentials
        AuthEP-->>UI: 401 Unauthorized
    else Admin Validated
        LoginSvc->>JWT: GenerateAccessToken(adminUser, device=null)
        LoginSvc->>JWT: GenerateRefreshToken(adminUser, device=null)
        LoginSvc->>DB: Insert RefreshToken entity
        LoginSvc-->>AuthEP: LoginResult.Success(AccessToken, RefreshToken)
        AuthEP-->>UI: 200 OK { accessToken, refreshToken }
    end

    Note over Staff,DB: 3. Token Refresh Flow (Single-Flight Rotation)
    UI->>AuthEP: POST /auth/refresh { refreshToken }
    AuthEP->>LoginSvc: RefreshAsync(rawRefreshToken)
    LoginSvc->>DB: Query RefreshToken by SHA-256(rawRefreshToken)
    alt Token Expired, Revoked, or Not Found
        LoginSvc-->>AuthEP: TokenRefreshResult.InvalidToken
        AuthEP-->>UI: 401 Unauthorized -> Force Logout
    else Token Active
        LoginSvc->>DB: Set existing RefreshToken.RevokedAt = UtcNow
        LoginSvc->>JWT: Issue new AccessToken & new RefreshToken
        LoginSvc->>DB: Insert new RefreshToken
        LoginSvc-->>AuthEP: TokenRefreshResult.Success
        AuthEP-->>UI: 200 OK { accessToken, refreshToken }
    end
